WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:08.575 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En mettant la main sur

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:09.809 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les 4000 films du studio MGM,

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.645 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Amazon et son service de

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.846 size:53% position:73% line:53%
visionnement frappent fort.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:14.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Amazon ne cesse de frapper

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:15.282 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des grands coups.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.483 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça va obliger les autres

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.018 size:53% position:73% line:53%
joueurs à se repositionner.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:20.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Fondé en 1924,

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:22.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le studio hollywoodien

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:24.057 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Metro Goldwyn Mayer est

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:26.092 size:53% position:73% line:53%
derrière de grands films comme

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:34.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Autant en emporte le vent",

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:36.136 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"2001, l'Odyssée de l'espace"

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:37.370 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et "Le magicien d'Oz"

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:38.571 size:53% position:73% line:53%
HÉLÈNE FARADJI, critique cinéma

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et là, avec l'achat de MGM,

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.041 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ça devient un joueur majeur

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:42.242 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'industrie audiovisuelle

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nord-américaine en particuler.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:44.677 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En achetant MGM pour la somme

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.912 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 8,45 milliards de dollars

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:47.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
américains, la plateforme de

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:48.348 size:53% position:73% line:53%
visionnement Amazon Prime Video

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.549 size:53% position:73% line:53%
obtient un catalogue important

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:50.784 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de films, et entre autres

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:56.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les franchises de "Rocky",

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:57.824 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de "James Bond" et de la série

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:59.059 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Le servante écarlante".

00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
BRUNO GUGLIELMINETTI, consultant

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.494 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en services numériques

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.729 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est ça qui est important :

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.930 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on met le grappin sur

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:05.131 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des propriétés intellectuelles

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:06.166 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et ça, ça vaut énormémment

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'argent.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.201 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MICHEL COULOMBE, critique cinéma

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:09.202 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Rocky", on peut ressortir ça

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.236 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à tout moment il y aura toujours

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.237 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un prétexte; et "James Bond",

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:12.271 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est inusable.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.272 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La preuve : il y a un nouveau

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.274 size:53% position:73% line:53%
film à l'automne.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.308 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La pandémie avait fait mal

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:16.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aux studio comme MGM, mais

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.344 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle a bénéfié aux service

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.345 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de visionnement comme

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Amazon Prime Video, qui a près

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:20.380 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de 200 millions d'abonnés

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:21.414 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à travers le monde.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:22.415 size:53% position:73% line:53%
DESTINY TCHEHOUALI, professeur,

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.450 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comm. sociale et publique, UQAM

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:24.451 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et là, cela affiche très

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.452 size:53% position:73% line:53%
clairement les ambitions

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.486 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Amazon de rivaliser

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.520 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec Netflix. Les stratégie

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:33.026 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'on voit à l'oeuvre

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:34.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
actuellement, stratégie fusion,

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:35.462 size:53% position:73% line:53%
hyper concentration...

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:36.663 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Qu'est-ce que

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:37.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette transaction veut dire

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:39.132 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour l'avenir du cinéma?

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:40.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un modèle hybride s'impose

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:41.568 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de plus en plus.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.802 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je ne pense pas que le cinéma

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:44.004 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en salle va mourir, mais

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.238 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je pense qu'on va distribue

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:46.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
moins de films, on va faire

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:47.674 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un tri.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.875 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Amazon est en train de

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:50.110 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nous dire : comptez avec nous,

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:57.450 size:53% position:73% line:53%
craignez-nous. C'est ce qu'à

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:58.651 size:53% position:73% line:53%
fait Disney en 2020 et c'est

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:59.853 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce que fait Amazon en 2021.

00:01:57.751 --> 00:02:01.054 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Comme dans un film

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:02.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'espionnage, la compétition

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
entre les géants du visionnement

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en ligne est pleine

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:05.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de rebondissements et

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.127 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de plus en plus féroce.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:08.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Hasta la vista, baby!

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ici Louis-Philippe Ouimet,

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
  Radio-Canada, Montréal.

